# Local Claude Code configuration — never publish.
#
# This repository is PUBLIC and is the primary install path for the project
# (DEC-241). `.claude/` was previously excluded only by `.git/info/exclude`,
# which is untracked and therefore lost on a fresh clone — so a re-clone would
# have offered to commit local Claude config, hooks and permission rules into a
# published repository. A tracked .gitignore is what actually survives a clone.
.claude/

# Editor / OS noise
*.swp
*~
.DS_Store
